  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to Trafficking for Forced Criminality from 2025 to 2026 (victim-centred approach)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to combat trafficking for forced criminality in Myanmar between June 2025 and March 2026. With a grant, it will support victim identification, strengthen local responses, and promote inclusive, gender-sensitive approaches, ensuring accountability and alignment with UK FCDO standards.</narrative>
  </description>
